{{#each results}}
== Relationships to other products

[TIP]
====
Record how this product relates to the other products in the solution. Link *from the part to the whole*. If this product is a part of another product, use the button that matches the relationship, and pick the other product:

* *Default component of*: it ships as a built-in part of the other product, not as a distinct product.
* *Optional component of*: it is an add-on, a plug-in, or a licensed extra for the other product.
* *External component of*: the other product needs it as an external dependency or library.
* *Installed on*: it runs on top of the other product, such as an operating system or a hardware platform.
* *Installed with*: it is bundled and installed together with the other product.

====

