== Where this product appears in the threat model

[TIP]
====
Link this product to the elements of the threat model that it implements. These are the processes, data stores, trust boundaries, and interfaces that it is the software or hardware behind. You can also link products on the element itself.
====

{{#if implements}}

Threat model elements:

{{#each implements}}
* {{#xref}}"cardKey":"{{this.key}}"{{/xref}}
{{/each}}

{{else}}

*This product is not linked to the threat model.* No element is recorded as implemented by it.

{{/if}}

{{#createLinks}}
  "buttonLabel": "Link threat model elements",
